      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761523200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Also allowed (not drawn)\n• stop from Starting or Running → Stopping\n• stop from Crashed → Stopped\n   (pending restart is cancelled)\n• start is rejected while a job holds the lock (409)\n   or below minimum resources (412, Owner may force)",
      "originalText": "Also allowed (not drawn)\n• stop from Starting or Running → Stopping\n• stop from Crashed → Stopped\n   (pending restart is cancelled)\n• start is rejected while a job holds the lock (409)\n   or below minimum resources (412, Owner may force)",
