      "text": "Job lock, not a state (OQ-15)\nWhile an exclusive job runs, activeJobId is set and\nthe panel shows a yellow \"Busy\" badge. The job moves\nthe state through the normal transitions, e.g. update:\nRunning → Stopping → Stopped → Starting → Running.",
